{"suttaId":"thag5.11","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[1676,1691],"vripara":"365"},"segments":{"thag5.11:0.4":"Soṇakuṭikaṇṇattheragāthā","thag5.11:1.1":"“Upasampadā ca me laddhā, vimutto camhi anāsavo;","thag5.11:1.3":"So ca me bhagavā diṭṭho, vihāre ca sahāvasiṃ.","thag5.11:2.1":"“Bahudeva rattiṃ bhagavā, abbhokāsetināmayi;","thag5.11:2.3":"Vihārakusalo satthā, vihāraṃ pāvisī tadā.","thag5.11:3.1":"“Santharitvāna saṅghāṭiṃ, seyyaṃ kappesi gotamo;","thag5.11:3.3":"Sīho selaguhāyaṃva, pahīnabhayabheravo.","thag5.11:4.1":"“Tato kalyāṇavākkaraṇo, sammāsambuddhasāvako;","thag5.11:4.3":"Soṇo abhāsi saddhammaṃ, buddhaseṭṭhassa sammukhā.","thag5.11:5.1":"“Pañcakkhandhe pariññāya, bhāvayitvāna añjasaṃ;","thag5.11:5.3":"Pappuyya paramaṃ santiṃ, parinibbissatyanāsavo”ti.","thag5.11:5.5":"… Soṇo kuṭikaṇṇathero …."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
